1
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:24,399
Could it be Wang Congjun,

2
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,000
or someone else?

3
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:35,680
Hello?

4
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,560
Hello.

5
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,960
This is the Nanjiang Traffic Police Brigade.

6
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,680
We received a report that

7
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,199
under the Changhong Road overpass,

8
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,479
your car was found parked there,

9
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,639
with no one inside.

10
00:02:44,639 --> 00:02:46,080
Do you need assistance?

11
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,360
What?

12
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,719
What is this crap?

13
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,319
Who's the jerk

14
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,759
who dumped this all over the road?

15
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,560
Did you check inside?

16
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,039
Search that whole area thoroughly.

17
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,520
Shine the light over there. Over there.

18
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,400
Brother...

19
00:03:34,039 --> 00:03:35,159
About what happened to Sister Xue...

20
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,280
could Wang Congjun have sent someone to do it?

21
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,919
Time for bed, Qingqing.

22
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:52,039
Daddy, you haven't put me to bed in forever.

23
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,400
Daddy's sorry.

24
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:59,639
Daddy will tuck you in every night from now on.

25
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,680
No, I want Mommy to tuck me in.

26
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,439
Where did Mommy go?

27
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,879
Mommy went out to take care of something.

28
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:10,280
Okay?

29
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,919
She went somewhere far away.

30
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:14,919
But...

31
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:16,399
Mommy will come back.

32
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:16,920
All right?

33
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,360
She'll be back in a couple of days.

34
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:21,920
Hey.

35
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:24,519
Daddy will tell you a story, okay?

36
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:28,120
Your stories are too scary. No.

37
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:31,240
Uncle Tang tells way better stories.

38
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:34,959
You like Uncle Tang that much?

39
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:35,800
Yeah.

40
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:39,160
Don't you like Uncle Tang, Daddy?

41
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,160
Of course I do.

42
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:45,360
Can you tell stories like Uncle Tang then?

43
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:46,480
Sure I can.

44
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:49,439
Um, Uncle Tang's...

45
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,560
"The Snail's...

46
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:56,959
...Dream."

47
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,199
Back up, back up!

48
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:06,720
All right, keep backing up.

49
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:10,439
Back up.

50
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,920
Hey, buddy.

51
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,000
Why are you late again today?

52
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,079
Alright, alright, you're always complaining.

53
00:05:21,639 --> 00:05:23,319
Running your mouth all day, give it a rest!

54
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,360
Am I only delivering to you?

55
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,279
I've got eight markets to cover!

56
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,560
Seriously.

57
00:05:28,199 --> 00:05:28,720
Come on.

58
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:31,439
You being late hurts my business!

59
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:34,000
You think you're the only one doing business?

60
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:43,759
Come on, man.

61
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,240
Give me a hand, will you?

62
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,600
Un... unload it yourself!

63
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,319
I'm in a rush to hit the next stop.

64
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,160
Just these two on the outside are mine, right?

65
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:58,959
What are you screaming for?

66
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,360
My leg! Leg, leg!

67
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,879
C-Call the police! Call the police!

68
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,279
Hello?

69
00:06:31,279 --> 00:06:33,160
Is this Chen Xue's husband, Wu Xiang?

70
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,399
Speaking.

71
00:06:34,639 --> 00:06:36,319
I'm with the Yujiang Criminal Investigation Detachment.

72
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:38,480
A criminal case occurred in our city last night.

73
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,800
Investigation shows it involves your wife, Chen Xue.

74
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,240
Please come in to assist with our investigation.

75
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,519
Mom...

76
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,519
I leave Xiaoxue's case

77
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,240
in your hands.

78
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:33,199
We also hope to solve the case soon

79
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:35,160
and get justice for your wife.

80
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,519
Hey.

81
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,439
What is it?

82
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,639
As for this case,

83
00:07:57,959 --> 00:08:00,399
it's very similar to the previous serial murders.

84
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:01,480
We've already gathered—

85
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:03,279
I want to take Xiaoxue home.

86
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,600
Not just yet.

87
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,800
Only after the forensic examination is complete

88
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,439
can the body be released.

89
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,360
In the meantime,

90
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:14,680
you need to fully cooperate with our investigation.

91
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:28,480
Let's go.

92
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,199
Coming.

93
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,360
Cheng Hao.

94
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:57,240
Yeah?

95
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:59,080
Find a way to ask around

96
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:00,840
and see what the police

97
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,600
actually have on this.

98
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,759
Let me know right away.

99
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,519
Got it?

100
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:11,840
Okay.

101
00:09:19,519 --> 00:09:20,080
Brother,

102
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,840
I had guys search everywhere nearby.

103
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,320
Nobody's seen Sister-in-law.

104
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,799
I'd better check Wang Congjun's place.

105
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:28,360
I don't think it was necessarily Wang Congjun.

106
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:31,519
He's caused us plenty of trouble over the years,

107
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,360
but he wouldn't go this far.

108
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,759
How long have you even been here?

109
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:36,960
What do you know?

110
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,320
Let me tell you,

111
00:09:41,399 --> 00:09:43,039
if our boss hadn't been so careful back then,

112
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,039
we'd have fallen into his traps countless times.

113
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,200
Maybe he targeted Sister-in-law this time

114
00:09:50,679 --> 00:09:51,639
just so the boss

115
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:53,039
would be too distracted to run the business.

116
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:53,799
Ah Tang,

117
00:09:56,159 --> 00:09:57,039
set up a meeting for me.

118
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,720
I want to see Wang Congjun.

119
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:01,519
Daddy.

120
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:07,639
Qingqing.

121
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:10,159
Did you find Mommy?

122
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:12,159
Well...

123
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:21,639
Uncle Tang,

124
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:23,399
do you know where Mommy is?

125
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:34,200
Mommy went to buy you some storybooks.

126
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,879
The nearby bookstores, though...

127
00:10:37,399 --> 00:10:39,159
you've already read all their books.

128
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,759
So...

129
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:43,320
So Mommy went somewhere farther away

130
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,080
to get books for you.

131
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,480
She'll be back to stay with you once she's done.

132
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:47,240
How about this?

133
00:10:47,679 --> 00:10:49,039
Go back to your room with Auntie first,

134
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:51,159
and I'll come read to you soon, okay?

135
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,840
I want to hear a story now.

136
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,240
Okay.

137
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,720
Then I'll take you to your room

138
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,799
and read you a story.

139
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:02,320
All right?

140
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,039
Come on.

141
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:08,559
Let's go.

142
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,159
Only the little snail,

143
00:11:13,919 --> 00:11:15,679
unhurriedly,

144
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:18,879
retreated into its shell.

145
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,279
It was a cozy home.

146
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,039
Though there were no windows inside,

147
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,480
and no furniture,

148
00:11:33,759 --> 00:11:34,720
it could still...

149
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,759
Its home

150
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,039
could shelter it from the wind

151
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,159
and the rain.

152
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:44,679
Uncle Tang, I miss Mommy.

153
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:47,039
Will Mommy ever come back?

154
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:50,559
I'm sure

155
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:53,759
Mommy misses you very, very much too.

156
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:55,759
Right?

157
00:11:58,639 --> 00:11:59,840
Go to sleep now, Qingqing.

158
00:12:21,399 --> 00:12:23,039
Have a drink with me.

159
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,720
I hope between the two of us,

160
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,799
there are no secrets.

161
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,600
I just want to ask you one thing:

162
00:12:35,559 --> 00:12:37,080
if the killer is found,

163
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,600
what will you do?

164
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:42,039
Brother,

165
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,960
once you find the killer,

166
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,159
what will you do?

167
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,480
Avenge your sister-in-law.

168
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,360
If anything happens to me,

169
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:58,440
take my place

170
00:13:00,519 --> 00:13:01,840
and take care of this family.

171
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,200
Promise me?

172
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:28,840
Brother,

173
00:13:30,279 --> 00:13:31,519
as long as I'm around,

174
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,279
this family will stay together.

175
00:14:03,279 --> 00:14:03,960
Congjun.

176
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,000
Hey, Brother Wu.

177
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,159
I knew you were coming,

178
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:07,799
so I stewed this for over two hours.

179
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,399
It's almost ready. Have some first. Come on.

180
00:14:09,639 --> 00:14:10,480
Hold off on the drinks for a second.

181
00:14:19,960 --> 00:14:21,039
About Sister Xue...

182
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,399
I heard about it.

183
00:14:24,559 --> 00:14:25,840
You can't bring back the dead.

184
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,200
Brother Wu.

185
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:28,759
My condolences, Brother Wu.

186
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,639
You're a man who owns up to what he does.

187
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,960
Tell me the truth.

188
00:14:34,519 --> 00:14:35,600
What happened to Xiaoxue...

189
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:37,000
was that your doing?

190
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:42,399
Brother Wu.

191
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,919
Over the years,

192
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:45,399
yes,

193
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,440
the two of us...

194
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,519
we've had some...

195
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:48,240
friction.

196
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:48,919
Right?

197
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,559
But what kind of man am I, Wang Congjun?

198
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,080
You know better than anyone.

199
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,919
Bringing family into it?

200
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,399
I'd never do something like that in a million years!

201
00:14:58,279 --> 00:14:58,639
Hey.

202
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:00,879
You don't believe me, do you?

203
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:01,480
Huh?

204
00:15:01,840 --> 00:15:03,440
Then let me make this clear right now.

205
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,000
If it turns out

206
00:15:06,279 --> 00:15:07,960
my men were behind what happened to Sister Xue,

207
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:11,480
I'll dismantle my own crew,

208
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,559
and hand everything over to you.

209
00:15:13,159 --> 00:15:14,919
I'll get to the bottom of Xiaoxue's death.

210
00:15:15,519 --> 00:15:18,639
Once I know the truth, I know what needs to be done.

211
00:15:21,519 --> 00:15:22,559
Now let's talk about

212
00:15:22,879 --> 00:15:23,919
what happened at the docks.

213
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,360
I don't want to talk about the docks.

214
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,519
You wouldn't believe me anyway.

215
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,120
Right?

216
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:32,159
That wasn't me.

217
00:15:35,759 --> 00:15:37,600
We've both worked under Snake King

218
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,879
for so long now.

219
00:15:40,039 --> 00:15:41,000
That's right.

220
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:44,240
We know how things work and got along fine.

221
00:15:44,759 --> 00:15:45,879
Each minding our own turf.

222
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,240
But if

223
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,320
you're interested in my business,

224
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:54,000
feel free to just say so.

225
00:15:56,159 --> 00:15:57,399
Oh, I am interested.

226
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:58,960
I'm extremely interested.

227
00:15:59,399 --> 00:16:00,600
Old Wu.

228
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:03,159
I'm not afraid to tell you, either.

229
00:16:04,279 --> 00:16:05,679
All the petty squabbles in the past,

230
00:16:05,679 --> 00:16:07,080
that was all me, Wang Congjun.

231
00:16:08,919 --> 00:16:09,840
For no other reason,

232
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:11,840
I just didn't want you getting too comfortable.

233
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:14,960
Otherwise,

234
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,720
you know how terrifying Snake King gets when he cracks down.

235
00:16:18,039 --> 00:16:19,279
Brother Wu, it's not like you don't know.

236
00:16:21,679 --> 00:16:23,559
In Yujiang, besides you,

237
00:16:23,559 --> 00:16:25,440
who else would have the guts?

238
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:29,240
As for these two incidents...

239
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:31,519
someone is clearly trying to frame me.

240
00:16:32,919 --> 00:16:34,440
Old Wu, I'll say it again:

241
00:16:35,279 --> 00:16:36,519
I'll own up to what's mine.

242
00:16:36,879 --> 00:16:38,200
But what isn't mine,

243
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,919
no one can pin it on me.

244
00:16:40,919 --> 00:16:41,759
That won't fly.

245
00:16:42,720 --> 00:16:43,720
Alright, come on.

246
00:16:45,399 --> 00:16:46,679
Pour a drink, Brother Wu.

247
00:16:46,679 --> 00:16:47,039
Come on.

248
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:58,879
Brother Wu,

249
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,399
how long has it been since you saw Snake King?

250
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,839
Probably that time with you.

251
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:14,119
It's been over a year.

252
00:17:15,519 --> 00:17:16,640
He never even shows his face.

253
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,359
Whenever he has a message,

254
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,359
Mr. Jing always passes it on.

255
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:25,599
But we risk our lives for Snake King,

256
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:28,079
not to work for Mr. Jing.

257
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,920
So what are you getting at?

258
00:17:39,319 --> 00:17:41,119
Here in Yujiang,

259
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:44,559
with the power the two of us have,

260
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:45,960
if we team up,

261
00:17:47,279 --> 00:17:48,759
would anyone even stand a chance?

262
00:18:02,599 --> 00:18:04,160
I think things are fine as they are.

263
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:08,319
What we just talked about...

264
00:18:08,599 --> 00:18:10,039
I'll pretend I never heard it.

265
00:18:13,359 --> 00:18:14,799
I didn't say a thing either.

266
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:15,440
Here, Brother Wu.

267
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,319
Drink, drink, drink.

268
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,839
The two factions of the Black Snake Syndicate...

269
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:23,000
we've already figured them out.

270
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,880
One is Wu Xiang,

271
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,640
and the other is Wang Congjun.

272
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:27,880
What about Snake King?

273
00:18:30,359 --> 00:18:31,240
He's already...

274
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,279
making a move.

275
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,359
We've been waiting for an opportunity.

276
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,960
How is your man?

277
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,400
He's safe for now.

278
00:18:47,359 --> 00:18:48,480
It's been three years.

279
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:50,839
I trust him.

280
00:19:37,559 --> 00:19:38,720
Have some candy, it won't hurt anymore.

281
00:20:22,079 --> 00:20:22,680
Here.

282
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:28,519
Wash up properly next time.

283
00:20:28,519 --> 00:20:29,960
Just eat.

284
00:20:34,839 --> 00:20:35,680
Tastes right, doesn't it?

285
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:43,480
Take this

286
00:20:43,839 --> 00:20:44,519
and rub it on there.

287
00:20:45,200 --> 00:20:46,039
You'll heal in a few days.

288
00:20:46,359 --> 00:20:46,839
Here.

289
00:20:53,119 --> 00:20:54,759
Wait, what is this, Old Zhu?

290
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,839
No label at all? Total knockoff.

291
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:00,960
This is my family's secret remedy.

292
00:21:01,799 --> 00:21:03,160
If you trust me, rub it on.

293
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,839
Ancestral noodles, ancestral medicine...

294
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,559
Are the chopsticks ancestral too?

295
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:09,559
Cut the chatter, will you?

296
00:21:10,519 --> 00:21:10,920
Do you want it or not?

297
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:12,279
If not, give it back. Hand it over.

298
00:21:13,599 --> 00:21:14,880
Never hurts to have extra.

299
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:17,079
You silly kid.

300
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:31,119
I went by your place earlier, but you weren't there.

301
00:21:31,960 --> 00:21:33,000
Figured you'd be here.

302
00:21:33,599 --> 00:21:34,440
What is it?

303
00:21:35,559 --> 00:21:36,839
Brother Wu called a meeting for everyone.

304
00:21:40,599 --> 00:21:42,039
Couldn't you have just called me?

305
00:21:42,039 --> 00:21:44,400
Brother Wu told me to come get you in person.

306
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:50,839
Where?

307
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,039
The docks.

308
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:55,319
Brother Wu.

309
00:22:55,319 --> 00:22:57,680
Brother Hao, please put in a word with Brother Wu.

310
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:58,960
I'm not a mole!

311
00:22:58,960 --> 00:22:59,559
Cheng Hao.

312
00:22:59,559 --> 00:22:59,920
Yeah.

313
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:03,279
I've been thinking about the docks and Xiaoxue.

314
00:23:03,279 --> 00:23:05,400
One of our brothers isn't clean.

315
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:07,160
This kid can't be the mole.

316
00:23:08,079 --> 00:23:08,880
Think about it.

317
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:10,000
The buyer suddenly turned on us,

318
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:11,759
which means our info leaked way earlier.

319
00:23:12,119 --> 00:23:13,279
He went with me.

320
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:15,720
If he were dirty, he would've driven off.

321
00:23:18,279 --> 00:23:19,480
Makes sense.

322
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:22,720
So if it's not him...

323
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:26,119
...then it's her.

324
00:23:34,559 --> 00:23:35,519
Don't touch me!

325
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,000
Ms. Yang.

326
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,400
Don't be scared.

327
00:23:53,599 --> 00:23:54,640
I just want to ask you one thing.

328
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,880
That day you went into the study,

329
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:58,079
was it really just to get art supplies?

330
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:01,480
Yes. So is there a problem?

331
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,759
No problem at all.

332
00:24:02,759 --> 00:24:04,319
It's just that right around that time,

333
00:24:04,319 --> 00:24:06,000
my business ran into trouble,

334
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:07,640
and something happened to Xiaoxue.

335
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:08,759
What a coincidence.

336
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,200
Who did it?

337
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:13,000
Not you, not you...

338
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:13,839
Then who was it?

339
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,039
Which one of you is it, anyway?

340
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,519
Brother,

341
00:24:46,599 --> 00:24:47,559
neither will admit it.

342
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:50,759
It wasn't her,

343
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:52,400
and it wasn't him.

344
00:24:56,079 --> 00:24:57,319
Which means...

345
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:02,000
it's him.

346
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:08,759
Brother Wu.

347
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:10,119
Brother Wu!

348
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:13,440
Brother Wu, someone is definitely framing me!

349
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:14,119
Brother Wu!

350
00:25:14,359 --> 00:25:14,880
Brother Wu!

351
00:25:14,880 --> 00:25:16,640
It wasn't me! It really wasn't me!

352
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,400
Zhang Shi, right?

353
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,839
Your real name is Zhang Shi,

354
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,799
isn't it?

355
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,599
What else do you have to say?

356
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,519
That night at the docks,

357
00:25:28,519 --> 00:25:31,559
you were the one who tipped them off.

358
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:44,240
Cheng Hao,

359
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:47,839
take Ms. Yang home first.

360
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,559
Brother Wu, someone's framing me! Brother Wu!

361
00:26:08,319 --> 00:26:10,279
Brother Wu, it really wasn't me!

362
00:26:20,400 --> 00:26:21,519
Yang Jingya, get in the car.

363
00:26:29,359 --> 00:26:30,400
It's dangerous out there right now.

364
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,920
I'm the only one who can protect you, understand?

365
00:26:32,359 --> 00:26:32,759
Ah!

366
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:33,880
Do you understand?

367
00:27:22,559 --> 00:27:23,240
Wait.

368
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:25,400
Give me your phone.

369
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:27,480
What for?

370
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,279
It's not safe out there lately.

371
00:27:39,279 --> 00:27:40,440
Here's my number.

372
00:27:40,799 --> 00:27:42,440
Call me if you're in danger.

373
00:27:47,279 --> 00:27:47,920
And another thing,

374
00:27:48,319 --> 00:27:50,160
don't tutor Qingqing anymore.

375
00:28:49,799 --> 00:28:51,200
What took you so long?

376
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:52,039
Did something happen?

377
00:28:53,839 --> 00:28:54,680
Zhang Shi.

378
00:28:56,359 --> 00:28:57,720
Something happened to Zhang Shi.

379
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,079
Are you safe?

380
00:29:06,480 --> 00:29:08,160
Why didn't you send police to the docks that day?

381
00:29:09,319 --> 00:29:10,599
If you had moved in to arrest Wu Xiang,

382
00:29:10,599 --> 00:29:12,359
this wouldn't have happened to Zhang Shi today.

383
00:29:15,319 --> 00:29:17,359
How many people have you planted around me?

384
00:29:17,359 --> 00:29:19,119
And how many more are going to disappear?

385
00:29:22,519 --> 00:29:24,079
I watched him end up like that,

386
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:25,880
and I couldn't do a thing.

387
00:29:26,920 --> 00:29:28,359
I couldn't do anything.

388
00:29:44,519 --> 00:29:45,160
Hey.

389
00:30:01,519 --> 00:30:03,119
Zhang Shi's sacrifice won't be in vain.

390
00:30:04,039 --> 00:30:05,079
That day,

391
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:07,759
he risked his life to tell me Snake King didn't show up,

392
00:30:07,759 --> 00:30:08,559
and that we couldn't close the net.

393
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:11,519
Our goal isn't to catch Wu Xiang.

394
00:30:11,519 --> 00:30:12,319
If we just wanted him,

395
00:30:12,319 --> 00:30:14,839
the evidence you've provided over the last four years is enough.

396
00:30:16,559 --> 00:30:17,759
Don't forget your mission

397
00:30:17,759 --> 00:30:19,039
is to catch Snake King.

398
00:30:19,559 --> 00:30:21,519
We're still looking into Chen Xue's case.

399
00:30:21,519 --> 00:30:24,160
We're not sure if the two are connected yet.

400
00:30:27,799 --> 00:30:29,839
What happened at the docks wasn't Wang Congjun's doing.

401
00:30:32,559 --> 00:30:34,559
So the people hunting me down that night

402
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:37,119
weren't his men either.

403
00:30:37,559 --> 00:30:38,200
Besides,

404
00:30:38,839 --> 00:30:40,799
the shipment at the docks vanished.

405
00:30:41,759 --> 00:30:43,039
There's more to this than meets the eye.

406
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,759
I now suspect

407
00:30:46,119 --> 00:30:48,480
someone else is stirring up gang infighting.

408
00:30:49,319 --> 00:30:51,279
Snake King won't let them cause such a mess.

409
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,559
He'll show up soon.

410
00:30:54,079 --> 00:30:55,200
You must stay alert.
